[2026-03-16T03:18:19.372Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C4PVCkM2PjJ1ydMSBaC6mJ","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me create a comprehensive report.\n\n## My Trips Page - Comprehensive Analysis\n\n### 1. POLISH PROGRESS (from /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/plan.md)\n\n**Current Status:**\n- **Accessibility:** MyTrips is NOT complete (checkbox empty) - still needs work\n- **Responsive UI:** MyTrips is NOT complete\n- **Performance:** PaginateAPIs not started\n\nThe following pages are already accessible:\n- LoginRegister ✓\n- HomeSearch ✓\n- PropertyDetail ✓\n\n---\n\n### 2. PAGE STRUCTURE OVERVIEW\n\n**Route:** `/trips`\n**Component File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\n\nThe My Trips page displays a user's bookings organized into three tabs:\n- **Upcoming** - Pending and confirmed bookings with check-in >= today\n- **Past** - Completed bookings\n- **Cancelled** - Cancelled bookings\n\n---\n\n### 3. COMPONENT HIERARCHY\n\n**MyTrips.tsx** (Page Container)\n```\nMyTrips (page)\n├── h1: \"My Trips\"\n├── Loading indicator (if loading)\n├── TripsTabs (component)\n│   ├── Tab buttons (Upcoming, Past, Cancelled)\n│   ├── FilteredBookingsList\n│   │   └── TripCard[] (for each booking)\n│   │       ├── Property image\n│   │       ├── Property title\n│   │       ├── Location (city, country)\n│   │       ├── Date range\n│   │       ├── Status badge\n│   │       ├── Total price\n│   │       ├── Cancel button (if pending/confirmed)\n│   │       ├── Write Review button (if completed & no review)\n│   │       └── Reviewed badge (if completed & has review)\n│   └── Empty state message\n└── CancelBookingDialog (modal - conditionally shown)\n    ├── Confirmation message\n    ├── Booking details preview\n    ├── \"Keep Booking\" button\n    └── \"Yes, Cancel\" button\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. COMPONENT FILES & LOCATIONS\n\n**Main Components:**\n\n1. **Page Component:**\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx` (58 lines)\n\n2. **UI Components:**\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx` (95 lines)\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx` (125 lines)\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx` (59 lines)\n\n3. **Redux Slice (State Management):**\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts` (140 lines)\n\n**Test Files:**\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-tabs.spec.ts` - Tab switching and empty states\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cards.spec.ts` - Trip card display and interactions\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cancel-dialog.spec.ts` - Cancel booking dialog\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-review-order.spec.ts` - Review ordering\n\n---\n\n### 5. KEY COMPONENTS BREAKDOWN\n\n#### **MyTrips.tsx**\n**Purpose:** Main page container and state management\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Requires authentication (redirects to `/login` if not logged in)\n- Uses Redux dispatch to fetch user bookings (`fetchUserBookings`)\n- Manages cancel dialog state\n- Displays loading indicator during data fetch\n- Passes bookings to TripsTabs component\n\n**Data Used:**\n- `currentUser.id` (from auth slice)\n- `bookings` array (from bookings slice)\n- `loading` state\n\n**Key Props Passed to Children:**\n- `bookings: Booking[]` → TripsTabs\n- `onCancelBooking: (booking) => void` → TripsTabs\n\n**Test IDs:**\n- `my-trips-page` (main container)\n\n---\n\n#### **TripsTabs.tsx**\n**Purpose:** Tab navigation and filtering logic\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Three tabs: \"Upcoming\", \"Past\", \"Cancelled\"\n- Active tab state management with `useState`\n- Filters bookings based on selected tab:\n  - **Upcoming:** `status === 'pending' || 'confirmed'` AND `check_in >= today`\n  - **Past:** `status === 'completed'`\n  - **Cancelled:** `status === 'cancelled'`\n- Sorts bookings chronologically by check-in date\n- Empty state messages for each tab with \"Browse properties\" link for upcoming\n\n**Styling:**\n- Active tab has `border-text` and `text-text`\n- Inactive tabs have `border-transparent`, `text-text-secondary`\n- Hover effects on inactive tabs\n\n**Test IDs:**\n- `trips-tabs` (container)\n- `tab-upcoming`, `tab-past`, `tab-cancelled` (tab buttons)\n- `trips-list` (content area)\n- `trips-empty-state` (empty message)\n\n**Navigation:**\n- Empty upcoming state links to `/` (home)\n\n---\n\n#### **TripCard.tsx**\n**Purpose:** Individual booking card display\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Displays property image (or \"No image\" placeholder)\n- Property title, location (city + country)\n- Formatted date range (e.g., \"May 1 – May 5, 2026\")\n- Status badge with color coding:\n  - Pending: yellow (`bg-status-pending/15 text-status-pending`)\n  - Confirmed: green (`bg-status-confirmed/15`)\n  - Cancelled: red (`bg-status-cancelled/15`)\n  - Completed: blue (`bg-status-completed/15`)\n- Total price in USD\n- Conditional buttons based on status:\n  - **Cancel button:** Shows if status is `pending` or `confirmed`\n  - **Write Review button:** Shows if status is `completed` AND `!has_review`\n  - **Reviewed badge:** Shows if status is `completed` AND `has_review`\n\n**Interactions:**\n- Clicking card navigates to property detail: `/properties/{property_id}`\n- Cancel button triggers parent callback (opens modal)\n- Review button navigates to: `/trips/{booking.id}/review`\n\n**Test IDs:**\n- `trip-card-{booking.id}` (card container)\n- `status-badge-{booking.id}` (status badge)\n- `cancel-button-{booking.id}` (cancel button)\n- `review-button-{booking.id}` (review button)\n- `reviewed-badge-{booking.id}` (reviewed badge)\n\n**Styling:**\n- Grid layout: image (w-40, h-32) + details (flex-1)\n- Rounded borders, hover shadow effect\n- Responsive: `max-sm:p-3` padding on small screens\n- Date/location with icons (Calendar, MapPin from lucide-react)\n\n---\n\n#### **CancelBookingDialog.tsx**\n**Purpose:** Modal confirmation dialog for canceling bookings\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Fixed overlay with semi-transparent backdrop (`bg-black/50`)\n- Centered modal with max-width\n- Shows booking details:\n  - Property title\n  - Check-in to check-out date range\n- Two buttons:\n  - \"Keep Booking\" - dismisses dialog\n  - \"Yes, Cancel\" - confirms cancellation (red background)\n- Click outside modal or dismiss button closes it\n- Stop propagation on button clicks to prevent closing\n\n**Test IDs:**\n- `cancel-dialog-overlay` (backdrop)\n- `cancel-dialog` (modal container)\n- `cancel-dialog-dismiss` (keep booking button)\n- `cancel-dialog-confirm` (yes cancel button)\n\n**Styling:**\n- White background, rounded, shadow\n- Responsive width with `max-w-md w-full mx-4`\n- Status red accent color for confirm button\n\n---\n\n### 6. DATA STRUCTURE\n\n**Booking Interface** (from bookingsSlice.ts):\n```typescript\ninterface Booking {\n  id: string\n  property_id: string\n  guest_id: string\n  check_in: string                    // ISO date string\n  check_out: string                   // ISO date string\n  num_guests: number\n  total_price: number\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests: string | null\n  created_at: string\n  property_title?: string              // Enriched from property data\n  property_city?: string               // Enriched from property data\n  property_country?: string            // Enriched from property data\n  property_image?: string | null       // Enriched from property data\n  has_review?: boolean                 // Enriched from review data\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. REDUX ACTIONS\n\nFrom `bookingsSlice.ts`:\n\n1. **`fetchUserBookings(guestId: string)`** - Async thunk\n   - Fetches from `/api/bookings?guest_id={guestId}`\n   - Called on page load in MyTrips.tsx\n   - Updates `state.items`\n\n2. **`cancelBooking(bookingId: string)`** - Async thunk\n   - Sends PUT to `/api/bookings/{bookingId}`\n   - Body: `{ status: 'cancelled' }`\n   - Updates booking in state with new status\n\n3. **`clearBookingError()`** - Action\n   - Clears error messages in state\n\n---\n\n### 8. ALL FILES RELATED TO MY TRIPS\n\n**Source Files:**\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx` (routing)\n\n**Test Files:**\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-tabs.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cards.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cancel-dialog.spec.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-review-order.spec.ts`\n\n**Documentation:**\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/plan.md`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md` (lines 607-700+)\n\n---\n\n### 9. PAGE STRUCTURE SUMMARY\n\n| Element | Type | Details |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| Page Container | div | `p-6 max-sm:p-3 max-w-4xl mx-auto` |\n| Heading | h1 | \"My Trips\", `text-2xl font-bold` |\n| Loading State | div | \"Loading trips...\" |\n| Tabs Container | div | 3 tab buttons with border-bottom styling |\n| Trip List | div | Grid of TripCard components |\n| Empty State | div | Context-specific messages (empty state per tab) |\n| Modal | CancelBookingDialog | Overlay dialog with confirmation buttons |\n\n---\n\n### 10. INTERACTIVE ELEMENTS\n\n**Buttons:**\n1. Tab buttons (3) - Upcoming, Past, Cancelled\n2. Card click area - Navigate to property detail\n3. Cancel button (on TripCard) - Open dialog\n4. Write Review button (on TripCard) - Navigate to review page\n5. Modal dismiss button - Close dialog\n6. Modal confirm button - Submit cancellation\n7. \"Browse properties\" link - Navigate home\n\n---\n\nThis comprehensive analysis covers all components, their interactions, data structures, and the complete file organization for the My Trips page feature."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a5d9394212d2c849e (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 49912\ntool_uses: 35\nduration_ms: 57610</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6c9eec15-4aa7-4280-9f57-4071abbe9889","uuid":"31aa34c1-58cf-4bff-b837-85dcee8db3c4","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the airbnb-clone app in /repo/apps/. I need to understand:\n1. Read docs/plan.md to see current polish progress\n2. Read docs/tests.md to see pages\n3. Find the My Trips page component and all components it uses\n4. Look at the page structure - what components, forms, modals, buttons, etc. are on the My Trips page\n\nBe thorough - find all files related to the My Trips page.","agentId":"a5d9394212d2c849e","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me create a comprehensive report.\n\n## My Trips Page - Comprehensive Analysis\n\n### 1. POLISH PROGRESS (from /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/plan.md)\n\n**Current Status:**\n- **Accessibility:** MyTrips is NOT complete (checkbox empty) - still needs work\n- **Responsive UI:** MyTrips is NOT complete\n- **Performance:** PaginateAPIs not started\n\nThe following pages are already accessible:\n- LoginRegister ✓\n- HomeSearch ✓\n- PropertyDetail ✓\n\n---\n\n### 2. PAGE STRUCTURE OVERVIEW\n\n**Route:** `/trips`\n**Component File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx`\n\nThe My Trips page displays a user's bookings organized into three tabs:\n- **Upcoming** - Pending and confirmed bookings with check-in >= today\n- **Past** - Completed bookings\n- **Cancelled** - Cancelled bookings\n\n---\n\n### 3. COMPONENT HIERARCHY\n\n**MyTrips.tsx** (Page Container)\n```\nMyTrips (page)\n├── h1: \"My Trips\"\n├── Loading indicator (if loading)\n├── TripsTabs (component)\n│   ├── Tab buttons (Upcoming, Past, Cancelled)\n│   ├── FilteredBookingsList\n│   │   └── TripCard[] (for each booking)\n│   │       ├── Property image\n│   │       ├── Property title\n│   │       ├── Location (city, country)\n│   │       ├── Date range\n│   │       ├── Status badge\n│   │       ├── Total price\n│   │       ├── Cancel button (if pending/confirmed)\n│   │       ├── Write Review button (if completed & no review)\n│   │       └── Reviewed badge (if completed & has review)\n│   └── Empty state message\n└── CancelBookingDialog (modal - conditionally shown)\n    ├── Confirmation message\n    ├── Booking details preview\n    ├── \"Keep Booking\" button\n    └── \"Yes, Cancel\" button\n```\n\n---\n\n### 4. COMPONENT FILES & LOCATIONS\n\n**Main Components:**\n\n1. **Page Component:**\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/MyTrips.tsx` (58 lines)\n\n2. **UI Components:**\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripsTabs.tsx` (95 lines)\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/TripCard.tsx` (125 lines)\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/CancelBookingDialog.tsx` (59 lines)\n\n3. **Redux Slice (State Management):**\n   - `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/bookingsSlice.ts` (140 lines)\n\n**Test Files:**\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-tabs.spec.ts` - Tab switching and empty states\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cards.spec.ts` - Trip card display and interactions\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-cancel-dialog.spec.ts` - Cancel booking dialog\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/my-trips-review-order.spec.ts` - Review ordering\n\n---\n\n### 5. KEY COMPONENTS BREAKDOWN\n\n#### **MyTrips.tsx**\n**Purpose:** Main page container and state management\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Requires authentication (redirects to `/login` if not logged in)\n- Uses Redux dispatch to fetch user bookings (`fetchUserBookings`)\n- Manages cancel dialog state\n- Displays loading indicator during data fetch\n- Passes bookings to TripsTabs component\n\n**Data Used:**\n- `currentUser.id` (from auth slice)\n- `bookings` array (from bookings slice)\n- `loading` state\n\n**Key Props Passed to Children